0},"640x480":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1715701/5ab4d82f-f435-43c1-bf2d-20b3120590ec.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1715701/5ab4d82f-f435-43c1-bf2d-20b3120590ec.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"Modern Ground Floor Apartment with Terrace & Parking | Gilching near Munich\n\nListing Description\n\nModern and stylishly furnished apartment in a quiet residential area of Gilching. Located on the ground floor, the apartment offers three comfortable bedrooms, a bright living area, a fully equipped kitchen, and a private terrace. Free parking is available directly on-site. With excellent connections to Munich, this home is ideal for professionals, families, project teams, and longer stays seeking comfort and convenience.\n\n⸻\n\nThe Apartment\n\nWelcome to your temporary home in Gilching. This spacious ground-floor apartment has been thoughtfully furnished to provide a comfortable and practical living experience.\n\nThe apartment features:\n\n* 3 fully furnished bedrooms\n* Bright and inviting living room\n* Fully equipped kitchen with dining area\n* Modern bathroom\n* Private terrace with outdoor seating possibilities\n* High-speed WiFi\n* Free parking directly at the property\n\nThe ground-floor location offers easy access and additional comfort, making it suitable for both short and extended stays.\n\n⸻\n\nNeighborhood & Location\n\nThe apartment is located at Uranusstraße 3, Gilching, a peaceful residential area in the western part of the Munich metropolitan region. Gilching is highly appreciated for its combination of green surroundings, excellent infrastructure, and convenient access to Munich.\n\nWithin a few minutes, residents can reach supermarkets, bakeries, restaurants, pharmacies, and other daily necessities. The surrounding area also offers numerous walking and cycling paths as well as beautiful green spaces for outdoor activities.\n\n⸻\n\nPublic Transportation\n\nThe apartment offers excellent transport connections for commuters and business travelers:\n\n* S-Bahn Station Gilching-Argelsried (S8) – approx. 10–15 minutes walking\n* S-Bahn Station Neugilching (S8) – approx. 15 minutes walking\n* Munich City Center (Marienplatz) – approx. 35 minutes by S-Bahn\n* Munich Central Station (Hauptbahnhof) – approx. 40 minutes by public transport\n* Munich Airport – direct connection via S8 without changing trains\n* Easy access to the A96 motorway, connecting Munich and Lindau\n\n⸻\n\nNearby Highlights\n\n* Gilching Town Center\n* Starnberg Lake (approx. 15 minutes by car)\n* Five Lakes Region (Fünfseenland)\n* Wörthsee\n* Ammersee\n* Munich City Center\n* Numerous restaurants, cafés, and recreational facilities nearby\n\n⸻\n\nOther Details to Note\n\n* Entire apartment for private use\n* Ground-floor location\n* Private terrace\n* Free on-site parking\n* High-speed WiFi included\n* Suitable for professionals, families, corporate stays, and longer-term guests\n* Quiet residential neighborhood\n* Excellent connection to Munich and Munich Airport\n\nThis apartment combines the tranquility of suburban living with convenient access to Munich, making it an ideal choice for comfortable stays in the region.","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"private"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"yes"},"bedrooms":{"value":"3"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"value":"no"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"laminate"},"garden":{"value":"no"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heating":{"value":"gas"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"private"},"kitchenware":{"value":"private"},"